This directory vendors icon data derived from Microsoft VS Code's built-in "Seti" icon theme
(extensions/theme-seti in https://github.com/microsoft/vscode), which is itself built from
Seti UI (https://github.com/jesseweed/seti-ui). icons.css and icons.js in this directory are
generated from vscode's extensions/theme-seti/icons/vs-seti-icon-theme.json (reduced to only the
icon definitions actually referenced by a file extension or file name); seti.woff is vendored
unmodified. Seti UI's license, as reproduced in vscode's own ThirdPartyNotices.txt for this
